 do not bear interest.\nL369@P12: Status: The Bonds will constitute direct, unsubordinated,\nL370@P12: unconditional and (subject to the Terms and Conditions)\nL371@P12: unsecured obligations of the Company and shall at all times\nL372@P12: rank pari passu and without any preference or priority among\nL373@P12: themselves. The payment obligations of the Company under\nL374@P12: the Bonds shall, save for such exceptions as may be provided\nL375@P12: by mandatory provisions of applicable law and subject to the\nL376@P12: Terms and Conditions, at all times rank at least equally with\nL377@P12: all of its other present and future direct, unsubordinated,\nL378@P12: unconditional and unsecured obligations.\nL379@P12: Form and Denomination: The Bonds will be issued in registered form in the specified\nL380@P12: denomination of RMB2,000,000 each and integral multiples\nL967@P28: “Listing Rules” the Rules Governing the Listing of Securities on the Stock\nL968@P28: Exchange\nL969@P28: “Maturity Date” September 16, 2027\nL970@P28: “Placee(s)” any professional, institutional or other investors procured by\nL971@P28: the Joint Placing Agents to subscribe for the Placing Shares\nL972@P28: pursuant to their obligations under the Placing Agreement\nL973@P28: “Placing” the placing of up to 21,965,000 new H Shares by the Joint\nL974@P28: Placing Agents at the Placing Price to the Placees under the\nL975@P28: terms and conditions of the Placing Agreement\nL976@P28: “Placing Agreement” the placing agreement dated September 12, 2026 entered\nL977@P28: into between the Company and the Joint Placing Agents in\nL978@P28: respect of the Placing\nL979@P28: “Placing Price” HK$714.00 per Placing Share (exclusive of all brokerage,\nL980@P28: Stock Exchange trading fees, SFC transaction levy and\nL981@P28: AFRC transaction levy)\nL982@P28: “Placing Shares” up to 21,965,000 new H Shares to be placed by the Joint\nL983@P28: Placing Agents pursuant to the terms and conditions of the\nL984@P28: Placing Agreement, and each a “Placing Share”\n"
